# Nouf-ex - CODEOWNERS
# D.8 in MASTER_PLAN.md - automatic reviewer assignment based on the
# files a PR touches. GitHub auto-requests review from the listed
# users/teams when a PR changes a matching path. See
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repository/setting-up-collaboration-on-github-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Format: <pattern>   <owner>
# Patterns use GitHub path glob syntax. The LAST matching rule wins
# (so order matters - more specific rules should come after more
# general ones). Lines starting with `#` are comments.

# === Default: 1 maintainer is required on every PR =============
